Adjacencies declared in-pair then kept physically distinct:
- **a1 BOS** is background-oriented schlieren pixel-shift density of a flare-header leak, not lock-in thermography (r23), not FID leftover, not TDLAS NH3 (r22), not UV-DOAS (r59), not paramagnetic O2 (r46), not window r21 OA-ICOS CH4.
- **a2 LIF OH** is laser-induced fluorescence of a cement-kiln flame, not CARS TIT (r29), not LII soot (r31), not CLD NOx (r52), not two-color pyrometer (r55), not phosphor-lifetime (r39), not leftover-mill r68 UV ozone.
- **a3 ESPI** is electronic speckle-pattern interferometry out-of-plane displacement of a hydrocracker skirt, not digital shearography (r33), not DIC hoop-strain (r51), not acoustoelastic birefringence (r47), not OCT TBC (r38), not window r41 bender-element.

